Package: com.albrhi.tiktok
Name: Albrhi for TikTok (rootless)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Scaffold only — no features built yet. Do not install.
 .
 The tweak's own structure exists so the source checks and the build script have
 something to run against while the real hooks are written; nothing here patches
 TikTok yet. See CLAUDE.md for the plan.
 .
 Reference architecture read from BandarHL's and al3raQe's published BHTikTok source
 (github.com/BandarHL/BHTikTok, github.com/al3raQe/BHTikTok) — no LICENSE file in
 either, so this is architecture read only, the same cautious way this project treats
 every unlicensed reference; no code is taken from it.
